{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0Included In the demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first two floors of the complex\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 explorable apartment's\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple characters to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The  unyielding Grandfather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A look at what is to come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single player experience\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590950/extras/antag_blurb.gif?t=1742827080\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Where are you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive at your home complex 629 but you lack all your memories but why? The other residents you meet along your journey deeper into the complex speak of the devil constructing the halls you wander. Be aware however for a violent spectre stalks the halls and he is The Grandfather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590950/extras/npc_chattin_final.gif?t=1742827080\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make your way through the structure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig your way through the halls by moving the snow manually or with the aid of consumables. To Find what lies at the end of the Complex you must collect money to purchase materials so you may complete the construction of your magnum opus. The key to regaining the memories that have been stolen away from you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590950/extras/shopstuff-export.gif?t=1742827080\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hoarding wealth and knowledge is okay in the end times\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Collect aspects of the devil to learn more about the complex and the world which lies outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In capitalism only the privileged prevail but since you can find money all over the complex you might have a chance to become rich! That would be if you didn't have to give it to the top 1% to progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590950/extras/steam_lorencash_final.gif?t=1742827080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590950?t=1742827080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590950?t=1742827080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590950/b070f16ef759a53cd31feb2f6815d622c06e9f38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742827080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590950/b070f16ef759a53cd31feb2f6815d622c06e9f38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742827080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Includes mature content"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0Included In the demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first two floors of the complex\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 explorable apartment's\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple characters to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The  unyielding Grandfather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A look at what is to come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single player experience\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class